  So there is no task model, no users, no persistence, no server, and no framework. "Notify users when tasks they care
  about change" presupposes all four: you need identified users, stored tasks, a place changes are observed, and a
  channel to reach someone who isn't looking at the page.

  That's the scope flag I want to raise before spending questions on notification details — the honest read is that
